  DEPLOY
    credmgr deploy <project> --target=user@host:/path/.env
    credmgr deploy <project>         Uses project SSH alias + deploy path

  INFO
    credmgr stats                    Store statistics
    credmgr projects                 List all projects
    credmgr verify                   Verify encryption + store integrity
    credmgr which                    Show store paths and version
    credmgr dashboard                Launch web UI on localhost:9876
    credmgr help                     This help message

  INTEGRATION (see docs/INTEGRATION.md)
    credmgr daemon                   Headless HTTP API for other projects
    credmgr daemon --bind 0.0.0.0    Expose on LAN (requires a token)
    credmgr daemon --cors            CORS allowlist = localhost origins only
    credmgr daemon --cors-origin=URL Repeatable: explicit origin allowlist
    credmgr token generate           Create a daemon bearer token
    credmgr token show|revoke|path   Manage the saved token (show = local file
                                     read; the HTTP API never returns the full
                                     token — rotate-to-reveal only)
    credmgr mcp                      MCP server for AI agents (Claude Code, Cursor)
